      GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ── Hero ── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">What's new</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">
      <span class="gradient-text">Changelog</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-sub">Every update, fix and improvement — shipped fast, because recruiters don’t have time to wait.</p>
