"<div class="bg-mesh" aria-hidden="true"><span class="blob"></span></div>
<header class="nav glass">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="index.html"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/josueluna/LinkedIn_to_Sheets/main/public/logo.png" alt="LinkedIn to Sheets logo" width="32" height="32" decoding="async"><span>LinkedIn to Sheets</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="index.html#how">See How It Works</a><a href="index.html#features">Features</a><a href="index.html#demo">Demo</a><a href="changelog.html">Changelog</a><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="#"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"></line><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"></line><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"></line></svg>Start Saving LinkedIn Profiles Now</a>
  </div>
</header>
<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"><div class="orb orb-1"></div><div class="orb orb-2"></div></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text reveal">
      <div class="beta-pill glass"><span class="dot-wrap"><span class="dot-ping"></span><span class="dot"></span></span>Now in private beta</div>
      <h1>Save LinkedIn profiles to Google Sheets in seconds<span class="gradient-text">No copy-paste. No tab switching. Just one click.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Built for recruiters, sales teams, and operators who source on LinkedIn daily.</p>
      <p class="workflow-line">Open profile → copy → switch tab → paste → repeat… hundreds of times</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn-primary lg" href="#beta"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>Install Chrome Extension</a>
        <a class="btn-glass" href="#how">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="fineprint">No data stored · Works with any Google account · No setup required</p>
      <p class="fineprint" style="opacity:0.8;">Used by recruiters sourcing hundreds of candidates weekly</p>
      <p class="fineprint" style="margin-top:0.25rem;">Takes less than 30 seconds to get started</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual reveal">
      <div class="mockup-wrap glass lift">
        <div class="chrome-bar chrome-bar-hero">
          <div class="chrome-dots"><span class="cdot cdot-r"></span><span class="cdot cdot-y"></span><span class="cdot cdot-g"></span></div>
          <div class="chrome-tab-pill"><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/josueluna/LinkedIn_to_Sheets/main/public/logo.png" width="12" height="12" alt=""><span>LinkedIn to Sheets</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup mockup-hero">
          <div class="mockup-inner">
            <video id="hero-video" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" preload="metadata" poster="media/preview.png"><source src="media/demo.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container ps-grid">
    <div class="reveal lift card-pad glass">
      <div class="icon-chip dest">✕</div><h3>The problem</h3>
      <p class="card-text">You know the drill:<br>open profile → copy → switch tab → paste → repeat. Hundreds of times a week. It's slow, repetitive — and it kills your productivity.</p>
      <ul class="bullet-list"><li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Constant tab switching kills your flow</li><li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Manual copy-paste leads to errors</li><li><span class="bullet-x">·</span> Duplicate candidates waste time</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal lift card-pad solution-card">
      <div class="icon-chip prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg></div>
      <h3>The solution</h3>
      <p class="card-text">LinkedIn to Sheets automates the most repetitive part of sourcing. Stay on LinkedIn. Your data updates automatically in Google Sheets. No friction, no switching tabs, no manual errors.</p>
      <ul class="bullet-list"><li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> One click captures the full profile</li><li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> Customisable column mapping</li><li><span class="bullet-ok">✓</span> Warns you if the candidate already exists</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="how" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>From profile to spreadsheet in four steps</h2><p class="section-sub">No setup headaches, no API keys. Just install, connect, and start sourcing faster.</p></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="step-head"><div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><line x1="21.17" y1="8" x2="12" y2="8"></line><line x1="3.95" y1="6.06" x2="8.54" y2="14"></line><line x1="10.88" y1="21.94" x2="15.46" y2="14"></line></svg></div><span class="step-num">Step 01</span></div><h3>Install the extension</h3><p>Add LinkedIn to Sheets from the Chrome Web Store in seconds.</p></div>
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:60ms"><div class="step-head"><div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"></line><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17"></line></svg></div><span class="step-num">Step 02</span></div><h3>Connect Google Sheets</h3><p>Sign in with Google and pick the spreadsheet and tab you want to fill.</p></div>
      <div class="step linkedin glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:120ms"><div class="step-head"><div class="step-icon linkedin"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle><path d="M7 21v-2a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v2"></path></svg></div><span class="step-num">Step 03</span></div><h3>Open any LinkedIn profile</h3><p>Browse LinkedIn the way you always do. The extension reads the profile in view.</p></div>
      <div class="step glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:180ms"><div class="step-head"><div class="step-icon prim"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 9l5 12 1.8-5.2L21 14z"></path><path d="M7.2 2.2 8 5.1"></path><path d="m5.1 8-2.9-.8"></path><path d="M14 4.1 12 6"></path><path d="m6 12-1.9 2"></path></svg></div><span class="step-num">Step 04</span></div><h3>Click "Paste Profile" and you're done</h3><p>Name, company, title, location and profile URL land in the right columns instantly.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="features" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Features</p><h2>Everything you need to source faster</h2><p class="section-sub">Thoughtful details that compound over hundreds of profiles a week.</p></div>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h3>Capture profiles in one click</h3><p>Reads the LinkedIn profile you're viewing and writes a clean row to your sheet.</p></div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:50ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="21" y1="4" x2="14" y2="4"></line><line x1="10" y1="4" x2="3" y2="4"></line><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line><line x1="21" y1="20" x2="16" y2="20"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="3" y2="20"></line><line x1="14" y1="2" x2="14" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="10" x2="8" y2="14"></line><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22"></line></svg></div><h3>Custom column mapping</h3><p>Decide exactly which column receives Name, Company, Title, Location and Profile URL.</p></div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:100ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"></polyline><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"></polyline><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10"></path><path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 0 1-14.85 3.36L1 14"></path></svg></div><h3>Duplicate detection</h3><p>Already added that candidate? You'll be warned with the row number — no double entries.</p></div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:150ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline></svg></div><h3>Multi-sheet support</h3><p>Switch between spreadsheets and tabs from the popup. Great for active pipelines.</p></div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:200ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3>Privacy-first</h3><p>Your data stays between your browser, your Google account and your sheets.</p></div>
      <div class="feature glass reveal lift" style="transition-delay:250ms"><div class="step-icon prim" style="margin-bottom:1rem"><svg class="icon-lg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3z"></path></svg></div><h3>Designed for high-volume sourcing workflows</h3><p>Designed around real sourcing workflows — fast, focused, no bloat.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DEMO SECTION -->
<section id="demo" class="section">
  <div class="container demo-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">See it in action</p>
      <h2>The popup that saves hours every week</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">A clean interface lives inside your browser. Connect Google, pick a spreadsheet, choose a tab, and paste the profile you're looking at — all from one focused popup.</p>
      <ul class="demo-list">
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Search across all your spreadsheets</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Pick the destination tab in one click</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Configure custom column mapping</span></li>
        <li><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg><span>Refresh the active profile anytime</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="demo-visual reveal">
      <!-- Chrome mockup wrapper — overflow:visible lets popup spill below -->
      <div class="chrome-mockup-wrapper">
      <div class="chrome-mockup">

        <!-- Title bar -->
        <div class="cm-titlebar">
          <div class="cm-dots"><span class="cm-dot cm-dot-r"></span><span class="cm-dot cm-dot-y"></span><span class="cm-dot cm-dot-g"></span></div>
          <div class="cm-tab-strip">
            <div class="cm-tab cm-tab-active"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LinkedIn_logo_initials.png" width="12" height="12" alt="" style="border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0;"><span>Sundar Pichai - LinkedIn</span><svg class="cm-tab-close" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg></div>
            <div class="cm-tab-add"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line></svg></div>
          </div>
        </div>

